OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog bans Dip's dishwasher
OL,4,Atablets ads
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn eco-friendly cleaning firm has had
OL,7,Fan advertising campaign banned by a
OL,8,Fwatchdog over health claims about
OL,9,Fdishwasher tablets.
OL,11,FDip, owned by Cara Capsules Ltd based
OL,12,Fin Olney, near Milton Keynes, used a
OL,13,Fpaid-for Facebook ad to take people to
OL,14,Fan article on "the top five
OL,15,Fbest-performing dishwasher tablets"
OL,16,Fsaid to be ranked by an expert team.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
