OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog bans Dip's dishwasher
OL,4,Atablets ads
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Advertising Standards Authority
OL,7,F(ASA) has said the ads must not appear
OL,8,Fagain and the firm must not "claim that
OL,9,Fusing standard dishwasher tablets was
OL,10,Fharmful to humans or make comparative
OL,11,Fclaims", while its marketing must be
OL,12,Fclearly identified.
OL,14,FCara Capsules said it accepted ASA's
OL,15,Fruling and had removed the ads within a
OL,16,Fweek of being contacted.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
